    "id": "kanbanCard",
    "name": "KanbanCard",
    "description": "LeanCards\tLean Cards are the \"demand\" drivers for a board. When Active Cards in a \"Available\" state exist - production can be applied to an individual card. Once a card enters a \"consumed\" state it is no longer considered active and a leveling method will be applied to determine when a new card should be added to the board.\t\nLinks out to production history",
